# Rust build artifacts
target/
**/target/

# Rust/Soroban: keep Cargo.lock checked in for reproducible WASM builds.
# Do not ignore Cargo.lock (see docs/rust-toolchain-policy.md).
!Cargo.lock
!**/Cargo.lock

# Soroban SDK ledger snapshots, written only when a test fails
test_snapshots/
**/test_snapshots/

# cargo-fuzz crash reproductions; the seed corpus in fuzz/corpus is committed
fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/artifacts/
